msgstr "Antiquity 帮助"

#: .\AQY\templates\AQY\AQYhelp.html:9 .\CNS\templates\CNS\CNShelp.html:9
#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:9 .\KFW\templates\KFW\KFWhelp.html:9
