msgstr "圣人统计"

#: .\AQY\templates\AQY\AQYstats.html:43
msgid ""
"Select a player count to compare how often each saint was available, picked,"
" and won."
msgstr "选择人数，比较每位圣人可选、被选与获胜的频率。"

