#| msgid "Website Help"
msgid "Indonesia Help"
msgstr "Indonesia 帮助"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:12
msgid ""
"Indonesia Rules Available <a class=\"linkOther\" "
"href=\"https://tesera.ru/images/items/174714/indonesia_E.pdf\" "
"target=\"_blank\" download>here</a>"
msgstr ""
"Indonesia 规则见 <a class=\"linkOther\" "
"href=\"https://tesera.ru/images/items/174714/indonesia_E.pdf\" "
"target=\"_blank\" download>此处</a>"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:25
msgid "You can view your Era cards in the \\"
msgstr "你可以在 \\ 中查看时代卡"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:33
msgid ""
"Change the map using the Settings icon. The maps all function identically - "
"it is just a visual change"
msgstr "用设置图标更改地图。所有地图功能完全相同 — 仅是外观变化"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:41
msgid "You can expand / collapse the Player Table using the button next to it"
msgstr "可用旁边的按钮展开/折叠玩家表格"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:50
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\profile.html:554
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\profileIND.html:13
#| msgid "Update Colour Preferences"
msgid "Indonesia Preferences"
msgstr "Indonesia 偏好"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:82
msgid "There is an option to play the game with hidden money."
msgstr "有隐藏资金游玩的选项。"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:85
msgid ""
"With this option selected, you will not be able to view a replay mid-game, "
"and the history will obscure the earnings  of other players."
msgstr "选中此选项后，游戏中途无法查看回放，历史会遮蔽其他玩家的收益。"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:92
#| msgid "New Game"
msgid "New Era:"
msgstr "新时代："

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:94
msgid ""
"Cards will automatically be discarded if there is no valid territory to "
"place a city. They will also be discarded if there are no more size 1 cities"
" available (very rare). You can check the history if you are unsure why you "
"turn was skipped."
msgstr "若无有效领土可放城市，卡牌将自动弃掉。若无 1 号城市可用也会弃掉（极少）。若不确定回合为何被跳过可查看历史。"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:100
msgid "Turn order:"
msgstr "回合顺序："

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:101
msgid "Remeber - you only get 1 chance to bid."
msgstr "记住 — 你只有一次竞标机会。"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:102
msgid "Mergers:"
msgstr "合并："

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:104
msgid ""
"In order to propose a merger, you require a high enough merger tech, a free "
"slot (or to own one of the merging companies), and enough money to start the"
" bidding. If you cannot propose any mergers your turn will be skipped - you "
"can check in the history for the reason. During your turn to propose a "
"merger, you can click on ANY slot to see why it is not available to merge; "
"either before or after you have selected the first slot. When placing any "
"bid, you can select the amount you want to bid right now, plus a maximum "
"bid, along with whether or not to pass when your maximum bid has been "
"exceeded. If you have placed a maximum bid, you will automatically bid in "
"the smallest increment possible, up to your maximum bid. Your maximum bid "
"must of course be at least 2 increments higher than your immediate bid - "
"otherwise there is no chance of you ever bidding that amount."
msgstr ""
"要提议合并，你需要足够高的合并科技、一个空位（或拥有其中一家合并公司），以及足够资金发起竞标。若无法提议任何合并，回合将被跳过 — "
"可在历史中查看原因。在提议合并的回合中，你可点击任一空位查看为何不能合并；选择第一空位前后均可。竞标时可选择当前出价、最高出价，以及最高价被超越时是否 "
"Pass。若设了最高价，将自动以最小增幅加价至最高价。当然最高价须比当前出价至少高 2 个增幅 — 否则永远不可能出到该价。"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:118
msgid "Acquisitions:"
msgstr "收购："

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:119
msgid "Click on a company deed on the map to acquire that company."
msgstr "点击地图上的公司契据以收购该公司。"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:120
msgid "R & D:"
msgstr "研发："

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:122
msgid ""
"You may either click on the highlighted “R&D” area of the main map, or use "
"the dropdown selector to choose your research."
msgstr "可点击主地图上高亮的“研发”区，或用下拉选择研究。"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:124
#| msgid "Setup Options"
msgid "Operations:"
msgstr "运营："

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:126
msgid ""
"You may select a slot to operate either by using the Player Table, or by "
"clicking on a production marker / ship on the map. When operating a land "
"company, remember you MUST ship the maximum possible goods. If you get into "
"a situation where you can no longer ship the maximum possible goods, you "
"will need to restart your turn and ship differently."
msgstr ""
"可通过玩家表格，或点击地图上的生产标记/船只选择要运营的槽位。运营陆地公司时，记住你必须运输尽可能多的货物。若陷入无法再运最大数量的情况，需重开回合并换方式运输。"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:135
msgid ""
"For example, if you have shipping chain 1 that can deliver to cities A and "
"B, and shipping chain 2 that can only deliver to city B, then the most "
"shipments can be done by using chain 1 for city A and chain 2 for city B, "
"for a total of 2 deliveries. However, if you use chain 1 to deliver to city "
"B, then you will be unable to ship any more goods. Thus because the maximum "
"possible deliveries is 2, you will need to restart your turn."
msgstr ""
"例如，运输链 1 可送 A、B 城，链 2 只能送 B 城，则最多 2 次运输为链 1→A、链 2→B。若用链 1 送 B，则无法再运更多货物。因最多 "
"2 次，需重开回合。"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:144
msgid ""
"If you only have un-operated shipping companies that cannot expand, your "
"turn will be skipped and one of those companies will be operated at random."
msgstr "若你只有无法扩张且未运营的运输公司，回合将被跳过并随机运营其中一家。"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:150
msgid "Auto Shipping:"
msgstr "自动运输："

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:151
msgid ""
"You can always Auto-Ship, which will provide you the cheapest possible way "
"to ship the maximum possible number of goods."
msgstr "你始终可自动运输，它会以最便宜方式运输最多货物。"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:156
msgid "You can click the \\"
msgstr "你可以点击 \\"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:159
msgid ""
"You can recalculate the auto-shipping options, as sometimes there are "
"multiple cheapest options; for example, if you could use 1 opponent's ship "
"to ship to city A or city B, then both routes would have the same cost. "
"Similarly, using 1 of your own ships to ship to city A has the same cost as "
"using 4 of your ships to ship to city B. Sometimes you may wish ship the "
"most possible goods, but not at the lowest cost; perhaps to grow a "
"particular city. You can always achieve this by shipping the goods manually."
msgstr ""
"可重新计算自动运输选项，因为有时有多个最便宜方案；例如用对手 1 条船送 A 城或 B 城费用相同。同样，用自己 1 条船送 A 与用 4 条船送 B "
"费用相同。有时你想运最多货物而非最便宜；或许为发展特定城市。始终可手动运输实现。"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:169
msgid ""
"You can also ship a good manually, using the above method, and then the "
"auto-ship table will automatically update to show the cheapest way to ship "
"the remaining goods."
msgstr "也可用上述方法手动运输一件货物，自动运输表会自动更新显示剩余货物的最便宜运输方式。"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:175
msgid "Manual Shipping:"
msgstr "手动运输："

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:176
msgid ""
"You click on a production marker, then a series of ships, and finally a city"
" in order to deliver goods manually."
msgstr "点击生产标记、一系列船只，最后点击城市以手动送货。"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:181
msgid ""
"You may also ship using one row of the auto-ship table at a time, using the "
"\\"
msgstr "你也可以每次使用自动运输表的一行运输，方式是 \\"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:183
msgid "Expert option - player selection:"
msgstr "专家选项 - 玩家选择："

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:184
msgid ""
"This option only affects games with 3 or more players. It allows you to try "
"to affect your relative net income compared to another player."
msgstr "此选项仅影响 3 人及以上游戏。可让你影响相对另一玩家的净收入。"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:190
msgid ""
"For example, if you as player A have the option to ship with player B at a "
"cost of 10 (which would result in player B gaining a net +20 against you "
"[-10 for you, +10 for them, is net +20]), and also the option to ship with "
"player C at a cost of 15, then de-selecting player B will result in player C"
" being favoured, even though the overall cost to you is slightly higher."
msgstr ""
"例如你作为玩家 A 可选与玩家 B 运输花费 10（玩家 B 相对你净 +20），也可与玩家 C 花费 15，则取消选择玩家 B 会偏向玩家 "
"C，即使你总花费略高。"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:197
msgid ""
"You can use this option to try to prevent your money going to a particular "
"player, even if it means gaining less money overall."
msgstr "可用此选项阻止钱流向特定玩家，即使总收入更少。"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:200
msgid ""
"Note: In the above exmple, if C had cost 20 instead, then the algorithm "
"would randomly pick between player B and C, because your relative change to "
"player B would be -20 (either player B gains 10 and you pay 10, or else you "
"pay player C 20)."
msgstr ""
"注意：上例中若 C 花费为 20，算法会在 B、C 间随机选择，因你对 B 的相对变化为 -20（B 得 10 你付 10，或你付 C 20）。"

#: .\IND\templates\IND\INDhelp.html:205
msgid "City Growth:"
