msgid "Updates"
msgstr "更新"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\changelog.html:15
msgid "Join Discord for discussion"
msgstr "加入 Discord 讨论"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\changelog.html:20
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\changelog.html:25
#| msgid "Updates"
msgid "Add Update"
msgstr "添加更新"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\changelog.html:43
msgid ""
"<strong>Site redesign complete.</strong> New visual design — cleaner lobby, "
"better mobile layout, Outfit font throughout. Feedback welcome on Discord."
msgstr ""
"<strong>网站重设计完成。</strong>新视觉设计 — 更干净的大厅、更好的移动布局、全程 Outfit 字体。欢迎在 Discord 反馈。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\changelog.html:51
msgid ""
"<strong>Roads &amp; Boats: canals and bridges expansion options "
"added.</strong> New creation options for the advanced map variants. Thanks "
"to vraid and Benkyo for the extended playtesting."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Roads &amp; Boats：新增运河与桥梁扩展选项。</strong>高级地图变体的新创建选项。感谢 vraid 与 "
"Benkyo 的扩展试玩。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\changelog.html:59
msgid ""
"<strong>Keyflower: winter tile rule clarification fixed.</strong> A corner "
"case in the scoring of winter tiles with meeples was being resolved "
"incorrectly. All current and future games use the corrected logic; finished "
"games are unaffected."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Keyflower：冬季板块规则澄清已修复。</strong>冬季板块带米宝计分的一个边界情况此前处理有误。所有当前与未来对局使用修正逻辑；已完成对局不受影响。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\changelog.html:67
msgid ""
"<strong>FCM: new Ketchup expansion options.</strong> The Ketchup expansion "
"pack is now selectable at game creation. Includes Luxury Meals, Outdoor "
"Seating, and the full set of 24 new staff cards. See Help for a summary of "
"the new rules."
msgstr ""
"<strong>FCM：新增番茄酱扩展选项。</strong>创建游戏时可选番茄酱扩展包。含豪华餐点、户外座位及全套 24 "
"张新员工卡。新规则摘要见帮助。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\changelog.html:75
msgid ""
"<strong>Tournament system update.</strong> Main Tournaments can now have "
"invited-player lists set at creation time. Invited players see an Accept / "
"Decline prompt when they visit the tournament page. Mini Tournaments are "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"<strong>锦标赛系统更新。</strong>主锦标赛创建时可设置受邀玩家列表。受邀玩家访问锦标赛页时会看到接受/拒绝提示。迷你锦标赛不变。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\changelog.html:83
msgid ""
"<strong>Notification improvements.</strong> Email and browser notifications "
"now batch moves made within a short window so you receive one message per "
"turn sequence rather than one per move. Opt-out remains available in profile"
" settings."
msgstr ""
"<strong>通知改进。</strong>邮件与浏览器通知现在会合并短时间内的多步操作，每个回合序列只发一条消息而非每步一条。仍可在个人资料中关闭。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\changelog.html:91
msgid ""
"<strong>Indonesia: ship transfer rules tightened.</strong> A bug allowed "
"ships to be transferred to a player who already owned the maximum allowed in"
" a single transaction. This is now correctly blocked."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Indonesia：船舶转移规则已收紧。</strong> "
"原先存在漏洞，允许将船舶转移给在单次交易中已达到持有上限的玩家。现已正确阻止。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\changelog.html:99
msgid ""
"<strong>Antiquity: city growth display.</strong> The city tile adjacency "
"highlight was not showing correctly for all map seeds. Fixed. Also: the "
"famine track now stays visible in the sidebar throughout the whole game "
"rather than disappearing after round 3."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Antiquity：城市成长显示。</strong>城市板块相邻高亮在部分地图种子下显示不正确，已修复。另外：饥荒轨现在整局保持在侧边栏可见，而非第"
" 3 回合后消失。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\changelog.html:105
msgid ""
"These entries are placeholders — real updates will appear here once the "
"changelog is populated."
msgstr "这些是占位内容 — 更新日志填充后将在此显示真实更新。"

