#| "here</a>.<BR /> To set up a webhook and find the URL to copy into your "
#| "Online Board Gamers Profile, <a href=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/en-"
#| "us/articles/228383668-Intro-to-Webhooks\" target=\"_blank\">click "
#| "here</a>.<BR /> Follow the guide to set up a webhook and \"Copy Webhook "
#| "URL\". Then paste the link in to your profile on Online Board Gamers. <BR />"
#| " Note that Discord notifications will be sent to a channel, not to your "
#| "private messages. <BR /> <BR /> <B><U>How can I add a Slack "
#| "Notification?</U></B><BR /> Create a slack app and enable/create an incoming"
#| " Webhook. Set it to post to a channel or your private messages. Then paste "
#| "the link in to your profile on Online Board Gamers.<BR /> For details on "
#| "each step, <a href=\"https://api.slack.com/messaging/webhooks\" "
#| "target=\"_blank\">click here</a>.<BR />"
msgid ""
"To set up your own free server, <a href=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/en-"
"us/articles/204849977-How-do-I-create-a-server-\" target=\"_blank\">click "
"here</a>. To set up a webhook and find the URL to copy into your Online "
"Board Gamers Profile, <a href=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/en-"
"us/articles/228383668-Intro-to-Webhooks\" target=\"_blank\">click here</a>. "
"Follow the guide to set up a webhook and \"Copy Webhook URL\". Then paste "
"the link in to your profile on Online Board Gamers. Note that Discord "
"notifications have to be sent to a channel, not to your private messages."
msgstr ""
"要搭建你自己的免费服务器，<a href=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/en-"
"us/articles/204849977-How-do-I-create-a-server-\" "
"target=\"_blank\">点此</a>。要设置 webhook 并找到可复制到你的 Online Board Gamers 资料的 "
"URL，<a href=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/en-us/articles/228383668-Intro-"
"to-Webhooks\" target=\"_blank\">点此</a>。按照指南设置 webhook 并“复制 Webhook "
"URL”。然后把链接粘贴到你在 Online Board Gamers 的个人资料中。注意 Discord 通知必须发送到频道，不能发到私信。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:99
#| msgid "Slack Notifications"
msgid "How can I add a Slack Notification?"
msgstr "如何添加 Slack 通知？"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:101
msgid ""
"Create a slack app and enable/create an incoming Webhook. Set it to post to "
"a channel or your private messages. Then paste the link in to your profile "
"on Online Board Gamers. For details on each step, <a "
"href=\"https://api.slack.com/messaging/webhooks\" target=\"_blank\">click "
"here</a>."
msgstr ""
"创建一个 Slack 应用并启用/创建传入 Webhook。将其设置为发布到频道或你的私信。然后把链接粘贴到你在 Online Board Gamers"
" 的个人资料中。各步骤详情见<a href=\"https://api.slack.com/messaging/webhooks\" "
"target=\"_blank\">此处</a>。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:108
#| msgid "Slack Notifications"
msgid "How can I add a Telegram Notification?"
msgstr "如何添加 Telegram 通知？"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:110
msgid ""
"Start by initiating a chat with @OnlineBoardGamers_Bot using this link:"
msgstr "先通过此链接与 @OnlineBoardGamers_Bot 开始聊天："

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:118
msgid ""
"Send any message to the bot. Then you should be able to click the link in "
"the reply from the bot to add Telegram notifications to your profile. If "
"this doesn't work, you can add your User ID to your profile page manually. "
"The easiest way to do this is to search for the \"userinfobot\" in the "
"search bar on Telegram. Say anything to it, such as \"/start\", or "
"\"hello\", and it should reply with your details, starting with a 10 digit "
"user ID. Copy and paste this into your profile, and then add and test the "
"webhook."
msgstr ""
"向机器人发送任意消息。然后点击机器人回复中的链接，即可将 Telegram 通知添加到你的个人资料。如果不行，你可以手动在个人资料页添加用户 "
"ID。最简单的方法是在 Telegram 搜索栏中搜索 \"userinfobot\"，对它说点什么（如 \"/start\" 或 "
"\"hello\"），它会回复你的详细信息，以 10 位用户 ID 开头。复制粘贴到你的个人资料，然后添加并测试 webhook。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:133
msgid ""
"<b>Note:</b> There are no specific starting options for Horseless Carriage, "
"Bus, and Antiquity"
msgstr "<b>注意：</b>《无马马车》《巴士》和《远古》没有特定起始选项"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:135
#| msgid "What are the game columns?"
msgid "What are the kickout icons?"
msgstr "踢出图标是什么意思？"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:137
msgid ""
"Kickout icons indicate how long someone has to be inactive before they can "
"be kicked out - this is the hard limit on the speed of a game."
msgstr "踢出图标表示某人不活动多久后可以被踢出——这是游戏速度的硬性限制。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:146
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:147
msgid "Kickout after 5 Minutes"
msgstr "5 分钟后可踢出"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:155
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:156
msgid "Kickout after 10 Minutes"
msgstr "10 分钟后可踢出"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:164
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:165
msgid "Kickout after 20 Minutes"
msgstr "20 分钟后可踢出"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:173
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:174
msgid "Kickout after 12 Hours"
msgstr "12 小时后可踢出"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:213
msgid "See \"General Gameplay\" for how kickouts work"
msgstr "关于踢出机制，请参见“通用玩法”"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:214
msgid "What are the times displayed in the lobby?"
msgstr "游戏大厅显示的时间是基于什么时区？"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:216
#| msgid ""
#| "Times are displayed according to the timezone of your device - so all times "
#| "will be in local time."
msgid ""
"Times are displayed according to the timezone of your device - so all times "
"will be in local time, in 24 hour format. To be precise, it uses the country"
" setting in your browser."
msgstr "时间按你的设备时区显示 — 所有时间为本地 24 小时制。准确地说，使用浏览器中的国家/地区设置。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:222
msgid ""
"The elapsed times underneath the date/times, eg 1h 5m 23s, indicates the "
"amount of time that has passed since the last move was made, or since the "
"game was created."
msgstr "日期/时间下方的耗时（如 1h 5m 23s）表示自上次走子或游戏创建以来经过的时间。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:227
msgid "What are the game columns?"
msgstr "游戏栏目有哪些？"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:229
msgid ""
"Available Games - Games that are available to join and are not waiting for a"
" repsonse from invited players"
msgstr "可加入游戏——可加入且无需等待受邀玩家回复的游戏"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:233
msgid "Current Games - Games you are currently playing"
msgstr "当前游戏——你正在进行的游戏"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:235
msgid ""
"Waiting Games - Games you have joined, but are waiting for more players "
"(either invited players or open to anyone)"
msgstr "等待中游戏——你已加入但仍在等待更多玩家（受邀玩家或公开）的游戏"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:237
msgid "Invitations - Games you have been invited to play"
msgstr "邀请——你被邀请加入的游戏"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:239
msgid ""
"Finished Games - Your finished games. Games you have resigned or been kicked"
" from will stop showing under \"Current Games\" but will show here once they"
" are finished"
msgstr "已结束游戏——你已结束的游戏。你认输或被踢出的游戏不再显示在“当前游戏”下，结束后会显示在这里"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:244
msgid ""
"If you create a game open to anyone, it will be shown under your \"Waiting "
"Games\" and also visible in \"Available Games\". If you create a game and "
"invite other players, it will be shown under your \"Waiting Games\" only, "
"until all invited players have responded."
msgstr ""
"如果你创建了公开游戏，它会显示在你的“等待中游戏”下，也会出现在“可加入游戏”中。如果你创建游戏并邀请其他玩家，它只会显示在“等待中游戏”下，直到所有受邀玩家回复。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:249
msgid "How can I leave a game that hasn't started?"
msgstr "如何离开尚未开始的游戏？"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:251
msgid ""
"Under \"Waiting Games\" there is a \"Leave\" button on the right. If you are"
" not waiting for specific players to join, you can also see the game under "
"\"Available Games\", with a \"Leave\" button on the left."
msgstr "在“等待中游戏”右侧有“离开”按钮。如果你没有等待特定玩家加入，也可以在“可加入游戏”中看到该游戏，左侧有“离开”按钮。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:256
msgid "Game Setup"
msgstr "游戏设置"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:258
#| msgid "Practice Game"
msgid "What is a Practice Game?"
msgstr "训练游戏是什么？"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:260
#| msgid ""
#| "Play with up to 6 players on the same device. You will make ALL moves. "
#| "Otherwise functions as a normal game. Useful for testing strategies or "
#| "trying new modules!"
msgid ""
"With a Practice Game, you will play as any number of players on the same "
"device. You will make ALL the moves, and it otherwise functions as a normal "
"game. This is useful for learning a game, testing strategies or trying new "
"options!"
msgstr "训练游戏中你可在同一设备上扮演任意数量玩家。你执行全部行动，其余与普通游戏相同。适合学规则、测策略或试新选项！"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:266
msgid "What is a Learning Game?"
msgstr "学习游戏是什么？"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:267
msgid ""
"Tick the \"Request Learning Game\" option to request help with learning the "
"game."
msgstr "勾选“请求学习局”选项以请求学习帮助。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:270
msgid ""
"When someone tries to join this game, it will notify them that the creator "
"has requested a learning game"
msgstr "当有人尝试加入此游戏时，会通知他们创建者请求了学习局"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:272
msgid ""
"Use the in-game chat, discord, or another convenient method to chat with "
"your trainer"
msgstr "使用游戏内聊天、Discord 或其他方便的方式与你的指导者交流"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:273
msgid "This game will be excluded from the stats"
msgstr "本局不计入统计"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:274
#| msgid "2 Player"
msgid "2 Player Only"
msgstr "仅 2 人"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:277
msgid ""
"Be aware that this does not force the person joining the game to help you; "
"it is just a request. Usually people will only join these games if they are "
"willing to help out though."
msgstr "请注意，这并不强制加入者帮助你；这只是请求。不过通常人们只会在愿意帮忙时才加入这类游戏。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:281
msgid "What is an Experienced Game?"
msgstr "熟练游戏是什么？"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:283
#, python-format
msgid ""
"An Experienced Game requires a minimum experience level in order to join. "
"This is to ensure only players with experience of the game, and experience "
"of this site join the game. The aim is to reduce the chance of someone "
"abandoning the game and needing to be kicked out. You need to have a Fair "
"Play rating of at least <b>80%%</b> in order to join an Experienced Game. "
"There is no required skill level; just a willingness to finish the game!"
msgstr ""
"经验局要求达到最低经验等级才能加入。目的是确保只有对该游戏和本站有经验的玩家加入，减少弃局和被踢的概率。加入经验局需要公平竞技评分至少 "
"<b>80%%</b>。没有技巧水平要求；只需愿意打完游戏！"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:295
#| msgid "Games (non-practice) in Progress"
msgid "Finished, non-practice games required"
msgstr "需要已完成的非训练游戏"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:336
msgid "Roads and Boats"
msgstr "Roads and Boats"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:342
msgid ""
"If you do not yet meet these requirements, and are unable to join an "
"available game, then try starting your own game and allowing anyone to join."
" Learning Games do count towards your experience level."
msgstr "如果你尚未满足这些要求且无法加入可用游戏，可以尝试自己开局并允许任何人加入。学习局计入你的经验等级。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:347
#| msgid "Change Playing Speed for different options"
msgid "What does the Playing Speed option do?"
msgstr "游戏速度选项有什么作用？"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:349
msgid ""
"The Playing Speed option mainly gives other players an idea of how fast you "
"want the game to play. It is also linked to the options for the length of "
"time before an inactive player is removed. Please note that often with 4 or "
"more random players then more than 1 or 2 moves a day could be difficult, "
"especially if people are in different time zones. With 2 or 3 players "
"however, it is certainly possible to play several games in an evening!"
msgstr ""
"游戏速度选项主要是让其他玩家了解你希望的游戏节奏，也与移除不活跃玩家的时间设置相关。请注意，4 人或更多随机玩家时，每天超过 1-2 "
"次走子往往较困难，尤其玩家分布在不同时区。不过 2-3 人时，一晚打几局当然没问题！"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:357
msgid "How much time do I have left in a game?"
msgstr "游戏中我还剩多少时间？"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:359
msgid ""
"You can see a timer counting down to the next kickout in the top right, "
"underneath where it says who you are logged in as. In fact, any game that is"
" within 20 minutes of a kickout will display the timer. No one will be "
"kicked out until a player enters the game who isn't currently required to "
"move, and then they need to also confirm that they would like to proceed "
"with the kickout. In games with 3 or more players, kicking a timed out "
"player instead requires a vote from a majority of the other players - see "
"\"General Gameplay\" below for details. All games will auto-update live, but"
" if you are playing with 5/10/20 minute kickout and your opponent doesn't "
"appear to be moving, then it is worth refreshing the game, in case you lost "
"internet signal at the same time the game update signal arrived."
msgstr ""
"右上角登录名下方可以看到距下次踢出的倒计时。实际上，任何距踢出不到 20 "
"分钟的游戏都会显示计时器。在当前无须走子的玩家进入游戏并确认继续踢出之前不会有人被踢出。3 "
"人及以上游戏中，踢出超时玩家需要其他大多数玩家投票——详情见下方“通用玩法”。所有游戏都会实时自动更新，但如果你玩的是 5/10/20 "
"分钟踢出而对手似乎不动，值得刷新一下游戏，以防你在游戏更新信号到达时恰好断网。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:376
msgid "General Gameplay"
msgstr "一般玩法"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:378
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\tournamentsHelp.html:120
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\tournamentsMiniHelp.html:83
msgid "How do kickouts work?"
msgstr "踢出如何运作？"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:380
msgid ""
"For every game with a kickout of 12 hours or above each player is alloted a "
"\"Flex-Time\" of 24 hours. If someone is inactive for longer than the "
"kickout duration set during game creation, then their Flex-Time will start "
"reducing. Once they have used all their Flex-Time, the game will have a bold"
" yellow highlight in your \"Current Games\" list. You can click on the game "
"to enter it, and will then be asked if you wish to kick the player, or allow"
" them more time. If you do kickout the player, they will be replaced by a "
"passive Bot, who just passes every move. Flex-Time is on a per-game basis - "
"each player has 24 hours of Flex-Time for the whole game. Remaining Flex-"
"Time can be viewed at the bottom of the \"Reserve\" screen, or underneath "
"the board in Bus. <br /> <br /> In games with 3 or more players, a timed out"
" player cannot be kicked out by a single player. Instead, the other players "
"are asked to vote on whether to kick them out, and the player is only kicked"
" once a majority of the other players have voted to kick them. Votes only "
"count while the player remains timed out - as soon as the game progresses, "
"any outstanding votes are cleared. If your vote to kick a player is more "
"than 2 days old, you can kick them out directly without needing the other "
"players to also vote - a countdown on the voting screen shows how long until"
" this is possible. In games with only 2 players you can kickout the other "
"player directly."
msgstr ""
"每个踢出时间为 12 小时或以上的游戏中，每位玩家有 24 "
"小时“弹性时间”。若有人不活跃超过创建时设定的踢出时长，其弹性时间开始消耗。弹性时间用尽后，该游戏在你的“当前游戏”列表中会以醒目的黄色高亮。你可以点击进入游戏，然后会被询问是否踢出该玩家或给更多时间。若踢出，该玩家将由只会每步过牌的被动机器人取代。弹性时间按局计算——每位玩家整局共"
" 24 小时。剩余弹性时间可在“储备”屏幕底部或《巴士》棋盘下方查看。<br /> <br /> 3 "
"人及以上游戏中，超时玩家不能被单个玩家踢出。其他玩家会被要求投票决定是否踢出，只有多数投票赞成后才会被踢。投票只在玩家仍超时期间有效——游戏一旦进展，未结投票即清除。若你踢出投票已超过"
" 2 天，可直接踢出而无需其他玩家投票——投票屏幕上的倒计时会显示还需多久可以这样做。只有 2 人的游戏中你可以直接踢出对方。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:399
msgid "What if I don't want to use kickouts"
msgstr "如果我不想使用踢出怎么办"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:401
msgid ""
"No player is ever forced to kick another player. In order to kickout another"
" player, you must enter a game that has timed out, and then confirm that you"
" would like to proceed with the kickout. So if you don't wish to use the "
"kickout then simply agree not to actively kick any player who hasn't moved. "
"In games with 3 or more players you are never forced to vote - you can "
"always allow the timed out player more time instead. The longest timer is 5 "
"days. If you are playing with friends you can agree not to kick anyone out "
"if they go over this limit. For games with random players, it is not really "
"fair to make people wait more than 5 days for a single move. If you do need "
"some extra time, then ask the other players using the in-game chat, and most"
" people are fine to wait a bit longer."
msgstr ""
"没有人会被迫踢出他人。要踢出其他玩家，你必须进入已超时的游戏并确认继续踢出。因此如果你不愿使用踢出功能，只需约定不主动踢出尚未走子的玩家。3 "
"人及以上游戏中你从不被迫投票——你总是可以选择给超时玩家更多时间。最长计时是 5 "
"天。如果和朋友玩，可以约定超过此限也不踢任何人。随机玩家游戏中，让别人为一步等超过 5 "
"天并不公平。若确实需要额外时间，请用游戏内聊天询问其他玩家，多数人会愿意多等一会儿。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:414
#| msgid "Need to move or risk being kicked out"
msgid "What is the penalty for being kicked out?"
msgstr "被踢出有什么惩罚？"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:416
msgid ""
"Everyone makes mistakes, the first kickout in a year will only count as a "
"loss, and not a kickout. Any further kicks will negate a win for your "
"statistics. In addition, if you are kicked out of a tournament game you will"
" be removed from the tournament."
msgstr "每个人都会犯错，一年内第一次踢出只记为负场，不计为踢出。之后的踢出会抵消你的胜场统计。此外，若你在锦标赛游戏中被踢出，将被移出锦标赛。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:424
msgid ""
"Resignation is available in all games, although it is discouraged in 3p+ "
"games. Resigning could unbalance the game for the remaning players, so it is"
" stronly encouraged to stay in the game, and try to meet an alternate "
"objective (eg don't come last, sell the most trucks, use all the marketeers,"
" etc)."
msgstr ""
"所有游戏都可以认输，但在 3 "
"人及以上游戏中不鼓励这样做。认输可能破坏剩余玩家的平衡，因此强烈建议留在游戏中并尝试达成替代目标（例如不要垫底、卖出最多卡车、用光营销人员等）。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:431
msgid ""
"You can resign during any Restructure phase. You can also resign at the "
"confirmation options when placing your initial restaurant. This will allow "
"you to exit games you didn't mean to join. It will still count as a loss in "
"your statistics."
msgstr "你可以在任何重组阶段认输。也可以在放置初始餐厅的确认选项时认输，从而退出误入的游戏。这仍计为统计中的一场失利。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:434
msgid "You can resign during the Research phase."
msgstr "你可以在研究阶段认输。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:437
msgid "You can resign during your 'Choose Actions' phase."
msgstr "你可以在“选择行动”阶段认输。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:440
msgid ""
"You can resign during your actions phase; as long as no one has exceeded "
"their VR. In this case the game will end in the current round anyway."
msgstr "只要无人超过 VR，你可以在行动阶段认输。这种情况下游戏无论如何都会在当前回合结束。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:443
msgid "You can resign during your 'place tiles' phase."
msgstr "你可以在“放置板块”阶段认输。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:446
msgid "You can resign during your 'City Build' phase."
msgstr "你可以在“城市建设”阶段认输。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:449
msgid "You can resign during your 'Turn Order Bid' phase."
msgstr "你可以在“回合顺序竞价”阶段认输。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:452
msgid ""
"You can resign during your 'Bidding and Actions' phase, as long as at least "
"one other player hasn't passed yet."
msgstr "只要至少还有一名其他玩家未过牌，你可以在“竞价与行动”阶段认输。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:455
#: .\WEB\templates\WEB\WEBhelp.html:94
msgid "You can resign before adding a tile to the grid."
msgstr "你可以在向网格添加板块之前认输。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:458
msgid "You can resign during your production turn (not during a pre-move)."
msgstr "你可以在自己的生产回合认输（预走子时不行）。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:460
msgid "What is the penalty for Resigning?"
msgstr "认输有什么惩罚？"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\lobbyHelp.html:462
msgid ""
"Please note that although resigning is discourageed in 3p+ games, at Online "
"Board Gamers players will never be penalised if they choose to resign. "
"Sometimes it is a valid (and best!) option. It will count as a loss."
msgstr ""
"请注意，虽然 3 人及以上局不鼓励认输，但在 Online Board Gamers 选择认输从不受罚。有时这是有效（甚至是最佳）选择。会计为负场。"

